@startuml
title Issued Certificate Directory - BIAN Control Record UML
' Machine-readable reconstruction of the raster BIAN Control Record diagram
' Service Domain: Issued Certificate Directory
' Source image: issued-certificate-directory-bom-uml.png
' BIAN source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_51667.html
' Extraction: raster reconstruction; labels normalized where legible
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "Issued Certificate Directory" as SD <<ServiceDomain>>
class "Issued Certificate Directory Entry" as CRT <<ControlRecord>>
class "Directory Entry" as GA <<GenericArtifact>>
class "Property" as BQT <<BehaviorQualifierType>>

class "CR Issued Certificate Directory Entry Instance Record" as CRI <<ControlRecordInstance>> {
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Version Number : Number
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Status : Status
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Usage Log : Log
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Reference : Identifier
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Update Log : Log
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Related Object : Identifier
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Description : Text
  + Issued Certificate Directory Entry Schedule : Schedule
}

SD "1" --> "1" CRT : defines control record
CRT "1" --> "0..*" CRI : instantiated as
CRT --> GA : conforms to generic artifact
GA --> BQT : qualified by

note right of CRI
  Source was a low-resolution PNG-only BIAN diagram.
  Text has been normalized for machine-readable context.
end note

@enduml
